WEBVTT

00:03:29.301 --> 00:03:32.934
to a panel of expert evaluators
sitting right in front of you,

00:03:32.958 --> 00:03:34.816
and to make sure you feel the pressure,

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.787
there are bright lights
and a camera in your face,

00:03:37.811 --> 00:03:39.270
kind of like this.

00:03:39.294 --> 00:03:40.452
(Laughter)

00:03:40.476 --> 00:03:43.356
And the evaluators have been trained

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:47.072
to give you discouraging,
non-verbal feedback,

00:03:47.096 --> 00:03:48.270
like this.

00:03:53.334 --> 00:03:54.335
(Exhales)

00:03:54.359 --> 00:03:56.756
(Laughter)

00:03:57.264 --> 00:03:59.332
Now that you're sufficiently demoralized,

00:03:59.356 --> 00:04:02.132
time for part two: a math test.